OL,5,BGoal                                   
OL,6, Development of started in January 2026.
OL,7, My goal was to get liveBNOS TeletekstG 
OL,8, pages running on myFC64 Ultimate,Gusing
OL,9, its networking capabilities, and to    
OL,10, display the Teletext pages as accurate 
OL,11, as possible.                           
OL,13,BFirst public release                   
OL,14, My first public release was onCMarch 4,
OL,15,C2026.GThe C64 Ultimate community liked 
OL,16, it and started to request adding other 
OL,17, Teletext services.                     
OL,19, At the end of March I added support for
OL,20,FARD-TextGfrom Germany,FCeefax & TeefaxG
OL,21, from the UK andFYLE Teksti-TVGfrom     
OL,22, Finland.                               
OL,23,D]F309G<<                >>F311 B]D1/6  
