OL,9,BJuly 2026                              
OL,10, July was a big month: the launch of the
OL,11, publicFpetsciiproxy.nlGserver. This was
OL,12, a big deal, because a local install of 
OL,13, PetsciiProxy was no longer needed.     
OL,15, Another big milestone was the hosting  
OL,16, of my program on theFWiC64 PortalGand  
OL,17, to be able to run it inFVICEGemulator! 
OL,18, Many thanks to theCWiC-teamGfor their  
OL,19, guidance and help!                     
OL,21, I personally love theFQuick Navigation 
OL,22, feature: 'walk' through page numbers   
